RESTful API Design

Farms
GET /api/farms - Retrieve all farms  
GET /api/farms/{id} - Retrieve farm by ID  

Crops
GET /api/crops - Retrieve all crops  

Soil Health
GET /api/soil - Retrieve soil data  

Farm-Crop Relationships
GET /api/farm-crops - Retrieve all farm-crop relationships  

Sustainability Initiatives
GET /api/initiatives - Retrieve all initiatives  
